{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35166","headline":"诗品二十四则 飘逸 · 司空图","name":"诗品二十四则 飘逸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落落欲往，矫矫不羣。\n缑山之鹤，华顶之云。\n高人画中，令色絪緼。\n御风蓬叶，泛彼无垠。\n如不可执，如将有闻。\n识者已领，期之愈分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}